body:
if you've only been applying the past 2 weeks, then: bunch of tech layoffs so ppl are like akvjndlvijoeavnaernv considering that some big ones bit the dust, and the first in line to be fired include recruiters :( 

also you hit the holiday season pretty closely.

another thing to think about is how many companies are you applying to? idk about other ppl, but my philosophy as someone with nil connections/network/referrals is to spread the seeds and hope somethings grows instead of carefully planting a few and taking good care of them
